# Title: PUA - Chisel Tunneling Tool Execution
# ID: 8b0e12da-d3c3-49db-bb4f-256703f380e5
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-13
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1090.001
# Description: Detects usage of the Chisel tunneling tool via the commandline arguments
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*\\chisel.exe) OR (((cmdline:*exe client * OR cmdline:*exe server *)) AND ((cmdline:*-socks5* OR cmdline:*-reverse* OR cmdline:* r:* OR cmdline:*:127.0.0.1:* OR cmdline:*-tls-skip-verify * OR cmdline:*:socks*))))
